     widget_list.c and variables.c.
(H8) FIXED 2026-05-21: pclose() → fclose() in 21 source files — calling pclose()
     on a FILE* returned by fdopen() (safe_popen) is undefined behaviour.
     Affected: signals.c + 20 widget_*.c files.

haplo-dialog — 1.0.0 — fixed (2026-05-21, patch 4):
-----------------------------------------------------------
(H9)  FIXED 2026-05-21: safe_exec.c rewritten — metacharacter detection
      (|&;<>(){}$`\"'~*?) with automatic /bin/sh -c fallback logged via g_debug().
      Resolves silent failures on all <input> commands using pipes or redirects.
(H10) FIXED 2026-05-21: safe_popen() zombie reaping — g_child_watch_add() +
      G_SPAWN_DO_NOT_REAP_CHILD added. No more zombie accumulation on polling widgets.
(H11) FIXED 2026-05-21: Dead GtkFileSelection code removed from actions.c and
      automaton.h (orphaned #else/#endif, two dead functions, actioncommand struct).
(H12) FIXED 2026-05-21: putenv() memory leak → g_setenv() in variables.c.
      Broken #if 0 block restructured (case labels were outside any switch after cpp).
(H13) FIXED 2026-05-21: free(program_src) → g_free() in gtkdialog.c
      (program_src was allocated by GLib — mixing allocators is UB).
(H14) FIXED 2026-05-21: strlen() signed/unsigned comparison in 23 files.
      count = strlen(line) - 1 with gint count → cast (gint)strlen(line) - 1.
(H15) FIXED 2026-05-21: widget_table.c — GtkCList fully replaced by
      GtkTreeView + GtkListStore. GtkCList was removed from GTK3. Full migration:
      natural sort (GtkTreeIterCompareFunc), MULTIPLE selection with GtkTreeRowReference,
      all XML attributes preserved (sort-function, auto-sort, column-header-active, …).

