haplo-dialog — 1.0.0 — fixed (2026-05-23, patch 18):
------------------------------------------------------------
(H30) FIXED 2026-05-23: XML comments <!-- ... --> caused parser crash.
      The ">" in "-->" was returned as a stray '>' token to Bison.
      Fix: new exclusive state ST_COMMENT in gtkdialog_lexer.l.
(H31) FIXED 2026-05-23: <frame label="text"> displayed literal string
      label="text" as GTK frame title. The old [^\>]+ regex passed the
      raw attribute string as ATTR_LABEL.
      Fix: PART_FRAME + ST_TAG_ATTR mechanism (gtkdialog_lexer.l,
      gtkdialog_parser.y, widget_frame.c).
(H32) FIXED 2026-05-23: <window> tag attributes default-width,
      default-height, width-request, height-request, resizable were
      parsed but never applied.
      Fix: widget_window.c reads all five via get_tag_attribute().
      Bonus: realize callback clamps window to 95% of monitor work area.
(H33) FIXED 2026-05-23: <edit> widget <input> command ignored with
      warning "not implemented".
      Fix: widget_edit_input_by_command() fully implemented.
(H34) FIXED 2026-05-23: AC_PROG_LN_S missing from configure.ac —
      $(LN_S) was empty, symlink gtkdialog→gtk3sermo not created.
(H35) FIXED 2026-05-23: autogen.sh VPATH trap — stale *.o and binary
      gtk3sermo in source tree caused make to skip recompilation.
      Fix: autogen.sh cleanup extended to remove compiled objects.

